# Client conventions

- Functional components + TypeScript; shared types in `client/src/types/ticket.ts`.
- Data: `useTickets` + `FiltersContext` / `LayoutContext` — don’t fetch tickets ad hoc in widgets.
- Interactive controls: use `.ix-chip` / `.ix-row` / `.ix-stat` or matching hover + `focus-visible`.
- Location UI: `LocationBadge` (add `interactive` when parent is a chip/group).
- DnD: `@dnd-kit` with grip handles; keep drag affordance without instructional banners.
- Display switcher in `Header` stays icon-only with `aria-label` / `title`.
- Styling: Tailwind + CSS variables in `index.css` (teal accent, dark canvas). Avoid purple-glow defaults.
- After UI changes, ensure Overview and Board still share filter behavior.
